---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Página no encontrada - Red Internacional de Memorias Participativas"
  description="La página que buscas no existe o fue movida."
  noindex
>
  <section class="notfound-shell">
    <div class="notfound-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="blob blob-a"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-b"></span>
      <span class="grid"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="notfound-wrap">
      <div class="notfound-card">
        <p class="notfound-kicker">Ruta rota</p>
        <div class="notfound-code" aria-hidden="true">404</div>
        <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
        <p class="notfound-text">
          El enlace que abriste no existe, fue movido o está escrito con una dirección incorrecta.
          Puedes volver al inicio o ir directo a las secciones principales.
        </p>

        <div class="notfound-actions">
          <a href="/" class="btn-green">Volver al inicio</a>
          <a href="/entradas" class="notfound-secondary">Ver entradas</a>
        </div>

        <div class="notfound-links" aria-label="Accesos rápidos">
          <a href="/simposios">Simposios</a>
          <a href="/acerca-de">Acerca de</a>
          <a href="/buscar">Buscar</a>
          <a href="/admin/login">Administración</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="notfound-aside" aria-label="Sugerencias">
        <h2>Qué puedes hacer ahora</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Revisar si la dirección tiene un error de escritura.</li>
          <li>Volver a la portada y navegar desde el menú principal.</li>
          <li>Usar el buscador para encontrar la entrada o memoria.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .notfound-shell {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 120px);
    padding: 48px 20px 72px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.14), transparent 34%),
      radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(112, 168, 122, 0.16), transparent 30%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f7faf4 100%);
  }

  .notfound-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .blob {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 999px;
    filter: blur(8px);
    opacity: 0.85;
    animation: float 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .blob-a {
    top: 7%;
    left: 8%;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    background: rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.12);
  }

  .blob-b {
    right: 7%;
    bottom: 14%;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    background: rgba(112, 168, 122, 0.14);
    animation-delay: -3s;
  }

  .grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), transparent 75%);
  }

  .notfound-wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(260px, 0.8fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .notfound-card,
  .notfound-aside {
    border: 1px solid rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.12);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .notfound-card {
    padding: 36px 34px 30px;
  }

  .notfound-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ugr-green);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .notfound-code {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.14);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(88px, 18vw, 180px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.08em;
  }

  .notfound-card h1 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ugr-green-dark);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 10ch;
  }

  .notfound-text {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ugr-text-light);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .notfound-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .notfound-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.22);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ugr-green);
    font-weight: 700;
    transition:
      transform 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .notfound-secondary:hover {
    border-color: rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    color: var(--ugr-green-dark);
  }

  .notfound-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .notfound-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 38px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.06);
    color: var(--ugr-green-dark);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition:
      background-color 0.2s ease,
      transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .notfound-links a:hover {
    background: rgba(47, 104, 12, 0.12);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .notfound-aside {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 30px 28px;
  }

  .notfound-aside h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ugr-green-dark);
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .notfound-aside ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--ugr-text-light);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .notfound-aside li + li {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-14px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .notfound-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .notfound-card,
    .notfound-aside {
      border-radius: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .notfound-shell {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 96px);
      padding: 24px 16px 48px;
    }

    .notfound-card {
      padding: 28px 22px 24px;
    }

    .notfound-aside {
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }

    .notfound-text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
